  "version": 1,
  "title": "Finite integer penalties and literal routing QUBO transport",
  "abstract": "A complete source-based finite penalty/energy family: the generic full ordered QUBO identity and strict integer-row minimizer equivalence, consistent fixed-coordinate energy/minimizer transport, and the literal incidence, time-indexed arc and sequence applications. The statements retain actual rows, repeated costs, full offsets, source free/fixed partitions, feasibility conditions, strict sufficient thresholds and finite source energy attainment. Capacity, physical route completeness and solver/quantum performance are outside scope.",
